# Foundational and synthetic works named by the July 2026 scoping review that have
# no record in `sources`. Each citation is TRANSCRIBED from the review (§10 core
# bibliography, §4 chronology, §5 edition tables) or from its bibliography-control
# CSV, and is NOT independently verified: access_status is `unknown` wherever the
# review did not supply a checked URL. Verify before relying on any of these for a
# locator. Apply with `ibi ingest --record-type source`.
{"source_type":"book","title":"Discoveries in the Ruins of Nineveh and Babylon","authors":"Austen Henry Layard; Thomas Ellis","issued_year":1853,"publisher":"John Murray","citation":"Layard, Austen Henry. Discoveries in the Ruins of Nineveh and Babylon. London: John Murray, 1853. Includes Thomas Ellis's decipherments of the incantation bowls Layard acquired.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"public_domain","notes":"Conventional beginning of JBA bowl scholarship (scoping review §4.1). The exact appendix locator for Ellis's bowl readings is not yet checked; establish it before citing any object to it."}
{"source_type":"book","title":"Inscriptions mandaïtes des coupes de Khouabir","authors":"Henri Pognon","issued_year":1898,"publisher":"Imprimerie nationale","citation":"Pognon, Henri. Inscriptions mandaïtes des coupes de Khouabir. Paris, 1898.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"public_domain","notes":"Foundational Mandaic bowl corpus (scoping review §5.2: 'foundational but requires modern rechecking'). Khouabir is a named findspot cluster the index does not yet carry; its bowls need enumerating."}
{"source_type":"article","title":"An Aramaic Incantation Text","authors":"J. A. Myhrman","issued_year":1909,"citation":"Myhrman, J. A. 'An Aramaic Incantation Text.' 1909.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"public_domain","notes":"Adds Hilprecht-collection material (scoping review §4.1). Container title, volume and pages are not given by the review and must be established before use."}
{"source_type":"book","title":"Mandaic Incantation Texts","authors":"Edwin M. Yamauchi","issued_year":1967,"container_title":"American Oriental Series 49","publisher":"American Oriental Society","url":"https://api.pageplace.de/preview/DT0400.9781463210229_A38590117/preview-9781463210229_A38590117.pdf","citation":"Yamauchi, Edwin M. Mandaic Incantation Texts. American Oriental Series 49. New Haven: American Oriental Society, 1967.","access_status":"partial","rights_status":"copyrighted","notes":"Early Mandaic corpus, grammar and glossary. Text 23 re-edits Montgomery 38 (CBS/B 2941) and is the worked example of one object crossing corpus systems. The only Yamauchi record currently in `sources` is a 2005 article, not this monograph."}
{"source_type":"book","title":"Corpus of the Aramaic Incantation Bowls","authors":"Charles D. Isbell","issued_year":1975,"container_title":"Society of Biblical Literature Dissertation Series 17","publisher":"Scholars Press","citation":"Isbell, Charles D. Corpus of the Aramaic Incantation Bowls. SBLDS 17. Missoula: Scholars Press, 1975.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"copyrighted","notes":"Concording compilation of then-published bowls; the review warns it is not reliable as a sole text edition because it inherits and sometimes adds earlier errors. Seventeen objects already carry `Isbell 1975::NN` designations reported by Waller 2022, with no record of Isbell itself. Its numbering is the natural crosswalk spine for pre-1975 publications."}
{"source_type":"book","title":"Amulets and Magic Bowls: Aramaic Incantations of Late Antiquity","authors":"Joseph Naveh; Shaul Shaked","issued_year":1987,"publisher":"Magnes Press; Brill","citation":"Naveh, Joseph, and Shaul Shaked. Amulets and Magic Bowls: Aramaic Incantations of Late Antiquity. Jerusalem: Magnes Press, 1985; 2nd ed., 1987.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"copyrighted","notes":"Set the modern standard for bowl edition, translation and formula comparison; listed as a core reference in the review's JBA edition table. Seven objects already carry `Naveh-Shaked 1985` designations with no source record behind them."}
{"source_type":"book","title":"Magic Spells and Formulae: Aramaic Incantations of Late Antiquity","authors":"Joseph Naveh; Shaul Shaked","issued_year":1993,"publisher":"Magnes Press","citation":"Naveh, Joseph, and Shaul Shaked. Magic Spells and Formulae: Aramaic Incantations of Late Antiquity. Jerusalem: Magnes Press, 1993.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"copyrighted","notes":"Companion volume to Amulets and Magic Bowls; core reference. One object already carries a `Naveh-Shaked 1993` designation with no source record behind it."}
{"source_type":"book","title":"Die Zauberschalentexte in der Hilprecht-Sammlung, Jena, und weitere Nippur-Texte anderer Sammlungen","authors":"Christa Müller-Kessler","issued_year":2005,"container_title":"Texte und Materialien der Frau Professor Hilprecht Collection 7","publisher":"Harrassowitz","citation":"Müller-Kessler, Christa. Die Zauberschalentexte in der Hilprecht-Sammlung, Jena, und weitere Nippur-Texte anderer Sammlungen. TMH 7. Wiesbaden: Harrassowitz, 2005.","access_status":"unknown","rights_status":"copyrighted","notes":"Hilprecht/Jena re-editions; the review advises comparing against Ford and Morgenstern. Two objects already carry `TMH 7::NN` designations with no source record behind them."}
